      "code": "hash_mismatch",
      "why": "§4.11's cause table row 3, stated at §5.2a corollary 1 and pinned since 0.8.2.24. Whether the peer closes afterwards is its own choice (§4.11) and neither shape is preferred. ⛔ SCOPE (0.8.2.26): this holds for a REFERENCED included entry. On an UNREFERENCED one §1.8 item 1 forbids a check requiring any refusal, so nothing below is scoreable there — see `scope_correction`."
    }
  ],
  "non_conformant": [
