      "",
      "⛔ SCOPE, BECAUSE THE PREDICTION IS ABOUT A COHORT AND THIS IS FOUR PEERS. The generator's three",
      "share one generation lineage — cohort-consistent, NOT independent convergence (AGENTS-STANDARD,",
